--- stderr
Error: --input "team" must be key=value
--- error
--input "team" must be key=value

===== a malformed --set-image =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_V1 --work-dir $BADIMAGE --non-interactive --namespace x --set-image nginxdemos/hello =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: --set-image "nginxdemos/hello" must be name=ref (both non-empty)
--- error
--set-image "nginxdemos/hello" must be name=ref (both non-empty)

===== upgrade adds a required input =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_REQUIRED --work-dir $WORK --non-interactive =====
--- stdout
Loaded prior install state from local.
--- stderr
Error: the new package adds 1 required input(s) that the prior install did not answer:
  - owner (string): Who owns the app
re-run interactively or run `installer wizard $WORK` to answer them, then re-run `installer upgrade`.
--- error
the new package adds 1 required input(s) that the prior install did not answer:
  - owner (string): Who owns the app
re-run interactively or run `installer wizard $WORK` to answer them, then re-run `installer upgrade`.

===== upgrade changes an input's type =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_RETYPED --work-dir $WORK --non-interactive =====
--- stdout
Loaded prior install state from local.
--- stderr
Error: input "team": strconv.Atoi: parsing "core": invalid syntax
--- error
input "team": strconv.Atoi: parsing "core": invalid syntax
